char* szName, MQ2Type* extension)\n\nThese functions allow you to extend an existing type by providing the\nname of the type you want to extend and the custom MQ2Type instance that\ndoes the extending.\n\nCurrently this works only for members. It will check for members of the\nextension type before checking members of the base type. Its sort of\nlike inheritance, but doesn't require modifying the original type.\n\nSee MQ2Test/MQ2Test.cpp for an example.\n\nAlso made some improvements and optimizations to the MQ2DataAPI code.", "created_at": "2017-01-07T10:52:25Z", "repo": "macroquest2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a9095027d7438d43da4a4008d5c1f793272ca61b", "message": "Update MQ2Camera", "created_at": "2017-01-07T09:00:57Z", "repo": "macroquest2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dac4e9c740f6b95d161c8b48fda6f527fa3fefee", "message": "switch to https urls for appveyor", "created_at": "2017-01-07T08:51:16Z", "repo": "macroquest2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "66ac45ae5cb3b5eb346bf9f032f2d4a55103ac7a", "message": "add .gitmodules file", "created_at": "2017-01-07T08:41:28Z", "repo": "macroquest2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c43421fe08226b02a49b57b82927190a36029957", "message": "Update submodules", "created_at": "2017-01-07T08:32:42Z", "repo": "macroquest2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c5faa01fdd03866fa7c0443fff73874e939a163d", "message": "Project file cleanup", "created_at": "2017-01-07T08:32:25Z", "repo": "macroquest2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bbe9dd1ed08cc48a77231e3a1299d248ddfc065b", "message": "Update .gitignore", "created_at": "2017-01-07T06:28:31Z", "repo": "macroquest2", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3761f6519a272edd